      "text": "▼ A. SAVE CONFIG (1–3)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "▼ A. SAVE CONFIG (1–3)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t107",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 103959,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 205671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Browser → nginx   HTTPS · PUT /api/config (topic + 22 keywords)\n\n2. nginx → examen-api   HTTP · PUT /config (+ X-API-Key header)\n\n3. examen-api → MongoDB   guarda en collection config\n   (topic_name + axes['general'].keywords)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Browser → nginx   HTTPS · PUT /api/config (topic + 22 keywords)\n\n2. nginx → examen-api   HTTP · PUT /config (+ X-API-Key header)\n\n3. examen-api → MongoDB   guarda en collection config\n   (topic_name + axes['general'].keywords)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t108",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 17,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 103996,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 205724,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "▼ B. TRIGGER CLASSIFIER + OUTPUTS (4–11)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "▼ B. TRIGGER CLASSIFIER + OUTPUTS (4–11)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t109",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 104033,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 205777,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Browser → nginx   HTTPS · POST /api/reclassify\n5. nginx → examen-api   HTTP · POST /reclassify\n6. examen-api → Docker socket   POST /containers/classifier-g3/exec\n   (httpx sobre Unix Domain Socket)\n7. Docker socket → classifier-g3   ejecuta pipeline rescore (~17s)\n8. classifier-g3 → examen-api   GET /config (keywords dinámicas;\n   fallback estático si offline)\n9. classifier-g3 → Bronze   lee bronze/index.parquet + PDFs (RO)\n10. classifier-g3 → Silver   escribe silver.{csv,xlsx,parquet} (2000 filas)\n11. classifier-g3 → Gold   copia PDFs Gold + clean_tier_prefix\n   (borra orphans) + ranking + report.md",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Browser → nginx   HTTPS · POST /api/reclassify\n5. nginx → examen-api   HTTP · POST /reclassify\n6. examen-api → Docker socket   POST /containers/classifier-g3/exec\n   (httpx sobre Unix Domain Socket)\n7. Docker socket → classifier-g3   ejecuta pipeline rescore (~17s)\n8. classifier-g3 → examen-api   GET /config (keywords dinámicas;\n   fallback estático si offline)\n9. classifier-g3 → Bronze   lee bronze/index.parquet + PDFs (RO)\n10. classifier-g3 → Silver   escribe silver.{csv,xlsx,parquet} (2000 filas)\n11. classifier-g3 → Gold   copia PDFs Gold + clean_tier_prefix\n   (borra orphans) + ranking + report.md",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t110",
      "type": "text",
