      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PUT /config             < 1s\nPOST /reclassify       async, 202 inmediato\nclassifier rescore     ~17s (con cache SBERT)\nsync Mongo desde parquet  ~5s\n────────────────────────────────\nTOTAL end-to-end       ~25–30s",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
