    {
      "id": "t117",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1290,
      "y": 1122,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB17",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 104329,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 206201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "· Red Docker compartida: stack_web (external).\n  examen-ui, examen-api, classifier-g3, mongodb,\n  minio resuelven hosts por DNS interno.\n\n· examen-api monta /var/run/docker.sock para\n  disparar classifier-g3 via Docker Engine API\n  (httpx sobre Unix socket — sin docker SDK).\n\n· classifier-g3: container con sleep infinity;\n  cada rescore es un docker exec puntual.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "· Red Docker compartida: stack_web (external).\n  examen-ui, examen-api, classifier-g3, mongodb,\n  minio resuelven hosts por DNS interno.\n\n· examen-api monta /var/run/docker.sock para\n  disparar classifier-g3 via Docker Engine API\n  (httpx sobre Unix socket — sin docker SDK).\n\n· classifier-g3: container con sleep infinity;\n  cada rescore es un docker exec puntual.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
